WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.954
Alex takes the candy.

00:00:03.274 --> 00:00:06.628
There's more in my car. Come on!

00:00:08.348 --> 00:00:14.860
Alex follows the grown-up, far away from Dad, all the way to the park gate.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.490
Snack time! ...Alex? Alex?

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:25.810
Dad came back, but Alex wasn't there. Dad doesn't know where Alex went.
